# === dsh-deepartments patch: dsh-tool-fs-search anchor literal-first-segment globs ===
#
# WHAT THIS FIXES
#   ripgrep matches --glob against the path AS PRINTED (CWD-relative), so a
#   literal-first-segment pattern under a `path` root silently found nothing.
#   This patch adds anchorGlobPattern (prefix `**/` ONLY when a path is given
#   and the first segment is fully literal) and applies it in
#   buildGlobCommand. The rc.1-era direct edit (fb-51, 2026-09-02) is NORMALIZED
#   to the exact compiled payload form; the pristine base here is the rc.2 file
#   with the fix reversed (reconstructed). See
#   dsh-tool-fs-search-fb51-direct-edit-normalize.patch for the live-tree
#   transition.
#
# TARGET FILES
#   <npm-root>/@deepseek-ai/dsh/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs-search/lib/index.js
#   <npm-root>/@deepseek-ai/dsh/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-fs-search/lib/types/glob.d.ts
#
# FINGERPRINTS (md5)  [pristine rc.2 (reconstructed) -> patched]
#  index.js           9d92d79d19288c8c3d6f353ff4516923 -> c1ecd7ac43eaf7923af050eee8249673
#  glob.d.ts          abb3e1903c42e878cb7bc76cece2ad90 -> ac12dc59628e934777f224164c5459fd
#
